[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158455528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122030#issuecomment-5158455528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122030","id":5158455528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM3fI6A","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T14:14:53Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T14:14:53Z","body":"IMO they should be named differently than `flip_h` and `flip_v`, as that suggests that the entire button (including text) is flipped, but it only flips the Icon.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158455528/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158530901","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122030#issuecomment-5158530901","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122030","id":5158530901,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM3jvVQ","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T14:28:43Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T14:28:43Z","body":"Yeah I originally thought so, too, but I wasn't sure if people wanted consistency, since `Sprite2D` and `TextureButton` have this property, or clarity, since they might think it works like them otherwise (flipping the entire displayed texture). I thought it was understandable from their locations in the Inspector (where most people do `Button` stuff), but I would need to see how others people would interpret it.\r\n\r\nIf the group prefix of `Icon Behavior` was `icon_`, then renaming it to `icon_flip_h` and `icon_flip_v` could've worked to prevent redundancy (so it appeared as only \"Flip H\" and \"Flip V\" in the Inspector), while in code the property name would've been clear to what it's referring to. But as it is, it seems like the other three properties would get excluded from the group if the group prefix was changed because they don't start with `icon_`. `flip_icon_h` and `flip_icon_v` could work, but slightly verbose in the Inspector.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5158530901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5159103254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122030#issuecomment-5159103254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122030","id":5159103254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM4GrFg","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T16:07:31Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T17:04:22Z","body":"Well `flip_X` in `Sprite2D` flips the entire sprite (which is expected), `TextureButton` is the same (can't have any text), so I would not keep the name to be consistent with them. `icon_flip_X` is better I think.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5159103254/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5160051592","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122030#issuecomment-5160051592","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122030","id":5160051592,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABM5AjiA","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-02T19:49:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T19:49:37Z","body":"I decided to go with `icon_flip_*` since it prevents confusion of what's being flipped exactly. As for the Inspector labels, I think it can be understood since many properties in Godot have stripped prefixes, too, but in that case, I still wonder about consistency with `TextureRect`, `TextureButton` etc, if people would automatically assume the same about `Button`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5160051592/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]